:: Danny Room Door
<<set _loc to getDannyLocation()>>
<<if _loc is "sleep">>
A note on the door: "Sleeping. Please don't wake me."
<<link [[Leave|Bedroom]]>><</link>>
<<elseif _loc is "work">>
A note: "At Niki's photography. Back later."
<<link [[Leave|Bedroom]]>><</link>>
<<elseif _loc is "school" or _loc is "walk" or _loc is "canteen" or _loc is "courtyard">>
A note: "At school. Back later."
<<link [[Leave|Bedroom]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link [[Knock and enter|Danny Room]]>><</link>>
<<link [[Leave|Bedroom]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Danny Room
You enter Danny's room. <<npc "Danny">> looks up.
<<if $dannyIntro isnot 1>>
  <<set $dannyIntro to 1>>
  "H-hey... I'm Danny. I live here too."
  <<npcincr Danny love 3>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Talk|Danny Talk]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Work on science schoolwork|Danny Room]]>><<npcincr Danny love 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Buy a new camera for them|Danny Room]]>><<npcincr Danny love 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<if Time.isWeekEnd()>>
  <<link [[Go somewhere together|Danny Outings]]>><</link>>
  <br>
<</if>>
<<if $dannyAccidentKnown is 1>>
  <<link [[Give diapers|Danny Room]]>><<npcincr Danny acceptance 5>><</link>>
  <br>
<</if>>
<<if C.npc.Danny.love gte 50>>
  <<link [[Hug|Danny Room]]>><<npcincr Danny love 2>><</link>>
  <br>
<</if>>
<<if V.loveInterest and V.loveInterest.primary is "Danny">>
  <<link [[Cuddle|Danny Room]]>><<npcincr Danny love 3>><</link>>
  <br>
  <<link [[Kiss|Danny Room]]>><<npcincr Danny love 4>><</link>>
  <br>
<</if>>
<<if $promiscuity gte 2>>
  <<link [[Flirt|Danny Room]]>><<npcincr Danny lust 3>><</link>>
  <br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Leave|Bedroom]]>><</link>>

:: Danny Talk
<<npc "Danny">>
What do you want to talk about?
<br>
<<link [[About day|Danny Talk Day]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[About work|Danny Talk Work]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[About them|Danny Talk Them]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $dannyAccidentKnown is 1>>
  <<link [[About continence|Danny Talk Continence]]>><</link>>
  <br>
  <<link [[About accidents|Danny Talk Accidents]]>><</link>>
  <br>
<</if>>
<<if ($pain gte 50 or $trauma gte 50 or $control lte 20) and !$daily.dannyBreakdown>>
  <<link [[Break down|Danny Talk Breakdown]]>><</link>>
  <br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Complain|Danny Talk Complain]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Back|Danny Room]]>><</link>>

:: Danny Talk Day
You ask how Danny's day is going.
<br><br>
<<if Time.schoolDay>>
  "School was... okay. Science was fine. I sat near the back again." <<npc "Danny">> fidgets with the camera strap. "How was yours?"
<<else>>
  "Pretty quiet. I worked most of the day at Niki's. Took some pictures of the shop window. How about you?"
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[It was fine|Danny Room]]>><<npcincr Danny love 1>><</link>>
<<link [[Rough|Danny Room]]>><<npcincr Danny love 2>><</link>>

:: Danny Talk Work
You ask about work.
<br><br>
"Niki's is good. They let me use the darkroom sometimes. I want to do portraits one day, but I'm still learning." <<npc "Danny">> smiles a little. "Do you like taking pictures?"
<br>
<<link [[Yeah|Danny Room]]>><<npcincr Danny love 2>><</link>>
<<link [[Not really|Danny Room]]>><<npcincr Danny love 1>><</link>>

:: Danny Talk Them
You ask about Danny.
<br><br>
"I'm just... me. I don't have a lot of friends. Photography is the thing I care about. And I don't want to cause problems for Bailey." <<npc "Danny">> looks down. "You're one of the only people who talks to me."
<br>
<<link [[I'm glad|Danny Room]]>><<npcincr Danny love 3>><</link>>
<<link [[Back|Danny Room]]>><</link>>

:: Danny Talk Continence
You ask about the bladder problem.
<br><br>
<<if C.npc.Danny.acceptance gte 500>>
  "It's... bad. I can't hold it for long. I've stopped fighting it as much." <<npc "Danny">> looks at you. "You're the only one who knows. Thank you for not telling."
<<else>>
  "I hate it. I wake up wet sometimes. I try to hide it. Please don't tell anyone." <<npc "Danny">> looks away, embarrassed.
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[I won't|Danny Room]]>><<npcincr Danny acceptance 3>><</link>>
<<link [[We can work on it|Danny Room]]>><<npcincr Danny continence 2>><</link>>

:: Danny Talk Accidents
You ask if there have been any accidents.
<br><br>
<<if C.npc.Danny.continence lte 2000>>
  "Yeah... this morning. I didn't make it. I cleaned up before anyone saw." <<npc "Danny">> fidgets. "It happens more when I'm stressed."
<<else>>
  "Not today. I've been careful. Still scared though."
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Okay|Danny Room]]>><<npcincr Danny acceptance 2>><</link>>

:: Danny Talk Breakdown
You break down a little. Danny listens.
<br><br>
"Hey... it's okay. You don't have to be fine all the time." <<npc "Danny">> sits closer. "I get it. Want to just sit for a bit?"
<br>
<<set $daily.dannyBreakdown to 1>>
<<link [[Thanks|Danny Room]]>><<npcincr Danny love 4>><</link>>

:: Danny Talk Complain
You complain about something small.
<br><br>
<<npc "Danny">> listens, then says, "Yeah, that sucks. Want me to take your mind off it? I can show you some photos later."
<br>
<<link [[Sure|Danny Room]]>><<npcincr Danny love 1>><</link>>
<<link [[Maybe later|Danny Room]]>><</link>>

:: Danny Outings
Where do you want to go?
<br>
<<if $dannyAccidentKnown is 1>>
  <<link [[Store for diapers|Danny Room]]>><</link>>
  <br>
  <<link [[Adult Store for diapers|Danny Room]]>><</link>>
  <br>
<</if>>
<<if C.npc.Danny.love gte 75>>
  <<link [[Photo shoot|Danny Room]]>><<npcincr Danny love 3>><</link>>
  <br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Back|Danny Room]]>><</link>>

:: Danny First Meeting Canteen
In the canteen Danny nearly bumps into you.
"S-sorry! I'm Danny. We both live at the orphanage, right?"
<<link [[Continue|School Canteen]]>><<set $dannyIntro to 1>><</link>>

